<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Documento histórico — <%= @proposal.proposal_number %></title>
    <%= vite_stylesheet_tag 'public_proposal.css' %>
  </head>
  <body class="m-0 bg-slate-100 p-4 font-sans text-slate-900 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:bg-slate-900 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:text-slate-100">
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-solid border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-8 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:border-slate-700 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:bg-slate-900">
      <header>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:text-emerald-300"><%= JrcCrm::DocumentBranding.name(@proposal.account) %></p>
        <h1 class="break-words text-2xl font-bold"><%= @proposal.title %></h1>
        <p class="text-sm"><%= @proposal.proposal_number %> · versão <%= @proposal.version_number %></p>
      </header>
      <p class="rounded-xl bg-amber-50 p-4 font-semibold text-amber-800 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:bg-amber-950 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:text-amber-200" role="status">Documento histórico — sem vigência comercial. Apenas para consulta; não permite aceite.</p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">O PDF preserva as condições originais. Para contratar, solicite uma nova versão vigente ao responsável comercial.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <%= link_to 'Visualizar PDF original', jrc_crm_historical_proposal_pdf_path(account_id: @proposal.account_id, token: params[:token]), class: 'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white no-underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-600' %>
        <%= link_to 'Baixar PDF original', jrc_crm_historical_proposal_pdf_path(account_id: @proposal.account_id, token: params[:token], download: 1), class: 'inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-solid border-emerald-700 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-emerald-800 no-underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-emerald-600 [@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)]:text-emerald-300' %>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm">Este acesso de consulta tem prazo limitado. Ele não reativa a proposta.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
